  "key_points": [
    "DELETE leaves obsolete row versions until cleanup is safe; ordinary VACUUM makes space reusable within the relation.",
    "Dead-tuple and autovacuum statistics are diagnostic clues, not exact bloat measurements.",
    "VACUUM FULL rewrites the table, needs extra disk space, and takes an ACCESS EXCLUSIVE lock."
  ],
